  axe-core and @axe-core/playwright   MPL-2.0           https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core
      Used unmodified. The MPL-2.0 source of axe-core is available at the address above.
  Ajv and ajv-formats                 MIT               https://ajv.js.org/
  parse5                              MIT               https://github.com/inikulin/parse5
  pdf-lib                             MIT               https://github.com/Hopding/pdf-lib
