Runtimes in the container image
  .NET runtime and ASP.NET Core       MIT               https://github.com/dotnet/runtime
  Node.js                             MIT-style (plus licences of bundled components)   https://nodejs.org/
  Eclipse Temurin (OpenJDK 21)        GPL-2.0 with Classpath Exception   https://adoptium.net/
